#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A Mercurial Genomics brand biofactory that replaces the user's blood with a "
"synthetic substitute.  Primarily designed to boost combat performance, its "
"common among the corporation's own security forces.  The biofactory can't be "
"removed once integrated with a host."
