#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A battered and used Compact Bionics Module that upgrades the user's power "
"capacity by 50 units.  Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to "
"using powered bionics.  The user will also need a power supply, found in "
"various CBMs."
msgstr ""

