#. ~ Description of bionic "HawkingCorps Mark V Shield"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Powerful and covert, the Mark V Shield is a military-grade shielding system developed for use within UICA's special service branches.  Although much more effective than anything that could be conceived with current technology, it remains a pale imitation of the Hyperspace Age systems it was reverse-engineered from.  A.\n"
"\n"
"Activating the shield will create an energy barrier capable of withstanding a modest amount of melee and ranged damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Kinetic Annulment System CBM"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A powerful shielding system salvaged from a pre-Discontinuity robotic "
"warframe, crudely adapted for compatibility with biological hosts.  Powerful "
"enough to completely stop most rifle cartridges.  Activating the field will "
"reduce incoming ballistic and piercing damage by 40 points."
msgstr ""

